# ...except the payment runbooks. These describe how to build and operate the
# infrastructure a live payment gateway depends on, contain no secrets, and are
# needed by whoever is on call — which is not necessarily whoever has this
# laptop. Losing them to an untracked directory is a real operational risk.
!docs/sbiepay-*.md
!docs/sbiepay-*.sh
